abstract: >-
  A reproducible, leakage-aware computer-vision study on the Augmented Alzheimer
  MRI dataset. It audits 40,384 images, quantifies cross-collection perceptual-hash
  leakage, builds original-only holdouts with an augmented quarantine guard, and
  benchmarks a classical HOG baseline and a compact CNN, with a Streamlit demo.
